            <title>[LU-20999] Remove outdated lctl commands</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20999</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Many old lctl commands are only used for testing (and marked dangerous in the --list-commands output). However, several no longer have any users in the Lustre test suite. We should remove these commands, to prevent users and admins from accidentally trying to use them.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
